{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Game Introduction</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This is a turn-based strategy game based on poker cards. Each poker card has a specific skill mechanism. You can also devour poker cards to gain new skills, collect high-scoring cards, and defeat enemies from different time and space (even yourself)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3424400/extras/Main_ScreenshotSize.jpg?t=1741112912\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Game Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">1. Card-based duel based on &quot;Texas Hold'em&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Using poker cards as the prototype, the points of poker cards are increased based on the card type, and the cards of both sides compete by comparing points.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3424400/extras/Snipaste_2025-02-14_13-03-18.jpg?t=1741112912\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">2. Devour evolution</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each poker card has skills with different mechanisms, and you can also buy poker cards to devour. Successful devouring increases the number of skills.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3424400/extras/\u541e\u566c.jpg?t=1741112912\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">3. Joker card relics</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">By building different relics, you can experience more genres.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3424400/extras/\u9057\u7269.jpg?t=1741112912\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">4. Asynchronous duel</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Your opponent is not an ordinary AI, but a player from different time and space, or even yourself.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3424400?t=1741112912","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3424400?t=1741112912","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3424400/966617b0898b40419c16b22f31a8f8854ee9e393/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1741112912","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3424400/966617b0898b40419c16b22f31a8f8854ee9e393/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1741112912","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3535250,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Game Introduction</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This is a turn-based strategy game based on poker cards. Each poker card has a specific skill mechanism. You can also devour poker cards to gain new skills, collect high-scoring cards, and defeat enemies from different time and space (even yourself)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3424400/extras/Main_ScreenshotSize.jpg?t=1741112912\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Game Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">1. Card-based duel based on &quot;Texas Hold'em&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Using poker cards as the prototype, the points of poker cards are increased based on the card type, and the cards of both sides compete by comparing points.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3424400/extras/Snipaste_2025-02-14_13-03-18.jpg?t=1741112912\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">2. Devour evolution</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each poker card has skills with different mechanisms, and you can also buy poker cards to devour. Successful devouring increases the number of skills.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3424400/extras/\u541e\u566c.jpg?t=1741112912\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">3. Joker card relics</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">By building different relics, you can experience more genres.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3424400/extras/\u9057\u7269.jpg?t=1741112912\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">4. Asynchronous duel</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Your opponent is not an ordinary AI, but a player from different time and space, or even yourself.</p>","developers":["HyperPoly"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3424400/header.jpg?t=1741112912","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257098820,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257098820/movie480.mp4?t=1739639931","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257098820/movie_max.mp4?t=1739639931"},"name":"Gameplay","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257098820/db6354b93e5b641e1da73352c145c446e0150f92/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1739639931","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257098820/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1739639931","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257098820/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1739639931"}}],"name":"Guangzhou Poker","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 MB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce GTX 650 or AMD Radeon HD 7750<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 245 MB available space